 * owner/operator credentials. This synthetic client grants the same scopes
 * as a CLI operator with all default scopes, ensuring agent runs via
 * `/v1/chat/completions` have access to gateway methods requiring
 * `operator.write` scope (like the embedded agent run itself).
 *
